@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Danh sach bai tap -> 200; JSON array co id, title, description, isOpen
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Chi tiet bai tap 1 -> 200; id = 1
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404; code = ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 4. Nop hop le -> 201; Location = /api/submissions/{id}; status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"dtc245200682","repositoryUrl":"https://github.com/Viet0810/CNTTK23E"}

### 5. Gui request 4 truoc -> 200; body trung luot nop vua tao
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Du lieu rong -> 400; code = INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"","repositoryUrl":""}

### 7. Luot nop khong ton tai -> 404; code = SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
